+- `plugins/leadv2/scripts/tests/test-review-gate-shows-findings.sh` — new suite, drives the
+  REAL engine with stubbed providers (codex/glm/architect/dispatch stubs, resolver stub —
+  same pattern as `test-review-engine-verifier-distinct-arm.sh`), six scenarios, 38
+  assertions.
+- `plugins/leadv2/scripts/tests/run-core-offline.sh` — registers the suite.
+- `plugins/leadv2/docs/phases.md` — documents the new gate surface for the lead.
